@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant ":System" as System

activate Editor

    Editor -> System : asks to add an industry
    activate System


    System --> Editor : requests data (position XY in the map, industry type)
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : types requested data
    activate System

    System --> Editor : shows all data and displays operation success
    deactivate System

@enduml